  "term": "peripheral nervous system",
  "definition": "The peripheral nervous system is the part of the nervous system outside the brain and spinal cord. It includes somatic and autonomic divisions; the autonomic division includes enteric, parasympathetic, and sympathetic parts, and the somatic division includes the cranial and spinal nerves, their ganglia, and peripheral sensory receptors.",
